# A.I.N.D.Y. Runtime — root-level .env.example
#
# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │  The canonical environment variable reference has moved.                │
# │                                                                         │
# │  See: AINDY/.env.example                                                │
# │                                                                         │
# │  The runtime reads AINDY/.env at startup                                │
# │  (Settings env_file = Path(__file__).parent / ".env").                  │
# │  Copy AINDY/.env.example → AINDY/.env and fill in real values there.   │
# │                                                                         │
# │  Docker Compose deployments: set values in this file (repo root .env)  │
# │  if your compose.yml uses env_file: .env. See                           │
# │  docs/runtime/DEPLOYMENT_PROFILES.md for the distinction.              │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
